# Only graph framework/fabricks. Two graphify quirks force this shape:
#  1. negation (!) can't re-include a pruned path, so no whitelist idiom.
#  2. `*` matches across `/`, so any glob (even /*.md) would recurse into
#     fabricks — every entry below is an exact dir or file, no globs.

# graphify's own output + tooling dirs
/graphify-out/
/.github/
/.claude/
/.vscode/

# framework siblings of fabricks
/framework/tests/
/framework/docs/
/framework/__pycache__/

# framework root files (live above fabricks, not in it)
/framework/standardize.py
/framework/pyproject.toml
/framework/README.md
/framework/format.sh
/framework/mkdocs.sh
/framework/mkdocs.yml
/framework/databricks.yml
/framework/uv.lock

